      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate and dedicated veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the kindness and dedication of veterinarians such as Dr. Perez, Dr. Lau, and Dr. Reinaldo. Pet owners appreciate staff who treat them like family and provide supportive care during difficult moments, though a few visitors felt customer service faltered during rushed visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and patient pet handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet parents describe gentle handling that keeps dogs and cats calm during routine vaccinations and exams. Reviewers appreciate veterinarians who take their time to comfort anxious pets, though one owner felt their pet was handled too impersonally before a procedure."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "prices",
      "sentiment": "negative",
      "mentions": 10,
      "title": {
        "en": "Affordable care alongside steep estimates"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "While some clients praise economical rates for routine wellness tests and walk-in checkups, multiple reviewers express frustration over expensive treatment plans. Dissatisfied owners cite high estimates for surgeries and dental procedures, as well as add-on fees and markup on prescription food."
      }
    }
  ],
  "faq": [
    {
