        "en": "Does Pet Lovers Animal Clinic accept walk-ins?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, pet owners report being able to bring pets in for same-day walk-in care, though waiting times can vary."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "What services are available at this clinic?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "The clinic provides general veterinary wellness care, vaccinations, examinations, surgery, and dental cleanings."
      },
      "basis": "both"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "How do clients describe the veterinary staff?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Most clients praise the veterinarians and technicians for their compassionate approach and attentive bedside manner."
      },
      "basis": "reviews"
    },
    {
      "q": {
        "en": "Are estimates provided before procedures?"
      },
      "a": {
        "en": "Yes, itemized estimates are provided, and reviewers recommend reviewing all proposed charges prior to major procedures."
